Description: Use the tested SIP package in nested build subprocesses
 The fixture changes directories before invoking Python. Without an explicit
 source path, those invocations can silently select an older system-installed
 SIP instead of the package under test. Preserve inherited Python paths while
 selecting the same package for code generation and standalone runtime builds.
